From eeaef5572c7283b3951b2a930ec7f23e22566964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:12:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Side-bar-only scale, Yes/No restart, Phone moves to Settings

- The Side Bar Scale setting now sizes only the nav rail; the control bar
  stays at 1x with the rest of the UI.
- The restart confirmation asks "Restart the radio now?" with No and Yes
  buttons instead of an icon and "cancel". Dialog gains set_cancel_text().
- The Phone page leaves the nav rail and becomes Settings > Phone, in place
  of the Bluetooth tab. It is created with Settings at startup, so phones are
  still reconnected when Dash starts.
